{"speciesId":456,"names":{"fr":"Écayon","es":"Finneon","en":"Finneon","ja":"ケイコウオ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"After long exposure to sunlight, the patterns on its tail fins shine vividly when darkness arrives."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The way its two tail fins flutter while it swims has earned it the nickname “BEAUTIFLY of the Sea.”"},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The line running down its side can store sunlight. It shines vividly at night."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Swimming and fluttering its two tail fins, it looks like a BEAUTIFLY. At night, the patterns on its tail fins softly shine."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Swimming and fluttering its two tail fins, it looks like a BEAUTIFLY. At night, the patterns on its tail fins softly shine."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La ligne qui fait le tour de son corps stocke l’énergie solaire et brille dans la nuit."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The line running down its side can store sunlight. It shines vividly at night."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La ligne qui fait le tour de son corps stocke l’énergie solaire et brille dans la nuit."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The line running down its side can store sunlight. It shines vividly at night."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The line running down its side can store sunlight. It shines vividly at night."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The line running down its side can store sunlight. It shines vividly at night."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"La ligne qui fait le tour de son corps stocke l’énergie solaire et brille dans la nuit."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"La línea que le recorre el costado puede almacenar luz solar. Brilla con mucha fuerza por la noche."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The line running down its side can store sunlight. It shines vividly at night."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体の 横側にある ラインは 太陽の光を ためておける。 夜になると 鮮やかに 輝く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Après une longue exposition au soleil, les motifs de ses nageoires caudales luisent à la nuit tombée."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Si se expone mucho al sol, los dibujos de sus aletas brillan en la oscuridad."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"After long exposure to sunlight, the patterns on its tail fins shine vividly when darkness arrives."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"太陽を いっぱいに 浴びた 尾びれの 模様は 暗くなると 鮮やかな 色で 光り出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La ligne qui fait le tour de son corps stocke l’énergie solaire et brille dans la nuit."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La línea que le recorre el costado puede almacenar luz solar. Brilla con mucha fuerza por la noche."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The line running down its side can store sunlight. It shines vividly at night."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体の 横側にある ラインは 太陽の光を ためておける。 夜になると 鮮やかに 輝く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Après une longue exposition au soleil, les motifs de ses nageoires caudales luisent à la nuit tombée."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Si se expone mucho al sol, los dibujos de sus aletas brillan en la oscuridad."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"After long exposure to sunlight, the patterns on its tail fins shine vividly when darkness arrives."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"太陽を いっぱいに 浴びた 尾びれの 模様は 暗くなると 鮮やかな 色で 光り出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il stocke les rayons solaires grâce aux parties roses de sa peau, qui brillent ensuite. Il s’agirait en fait d’une technique de camouflage."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Las marcas rosadas de su piel brillan con intensidad tras almacenar luz solar. Se cree que esta característica le permite camuflarse."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It absorbs sunlight with the pink areas of its skin, which then shine. This appears to be a form of camouflage."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"ピンク色の 皮の 部分は 太陽光を 溜めて 光る。 カモフラージュの ためと いわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Avec sa double nageoire caudale, il peut bondir hors de l’eau. C’est souvent à ce moment que les Goélise de passage l’attrapent et le gobent."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Sus dos aletas le permiten saltar fuera del agua, momento que aprovechan los Wingull para llevárselos al buche."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Its double tail fins propel its energetic jumps. When it breaks the surface of the sea, Wingull swoop down to grab it on the fly."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"２枚の 尾ビレで 元気にジャンプ。 海面に 飛びあがった ところを キャモメが くわえ さらっていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Les motifs roses de sa peau brillent la nuit. Des stations balnéaires l’attirent avec de la nourriture, car il est très aimé des plongeurs."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Las marcas rosadas de su piel brillan al caer la noche. Triunfa entre los buceadores, por eso en los resorts turísticos le proporcionan alimento."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"When night falls, their pink patterns begin to shine. They’re popular with divers, so there are resorts that feed them to keep them close."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ピンク色の 模様は 夜になると 光りだす。 ダイバーに 人気なので リゾート地では 餌付けされることも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il attire ses proies avec ses nageoires caudales lumineuses. Il passe la journée à la surface et se retire dans les abysses la nuit venue."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Por el día permanece cerca de la superficie y se retira a las profundidades por la noche. Atrae a las presas con sus brillantes aletas caudales."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It lures in prey with its shining tail fins. It stays near the surface during the day and moves to the depths when night falls."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"光る 尾びれで 獲物を 誘う。 昼は 海面 近くに いて 夜に なると 深みに 移動。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"What a gorgeous sight this Pokémon is as it swims with its long, pink-painted caudal fins fluttering behind it. Finneon's beautiful appearance has led to its nickname: ”finery fish.”"}],"varieties":[{"id":456,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"gust","learns":[[8,"level-up",17],[9,"level-up",17],[10,"level-up",17],[11,"level-up",17],[14,"level-up",17],[15,"level-up",17],[16,"level-up",17],[17,"level-up",17],[18,"level-up",17],[23,"level-up",17],[24,"level-up",6],[25,"level-up",17]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[8,"level-up",6],[9,"level-up",6],[10,"level-up",6],[11,"level-up",6],[14,"level-up",6],[15,"level-up",6],[16,"level-up",6],[17,"level-up",6],[18,"level-up",6],[23,"level-up",6],[25,"level-up",6]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[24,"level-up",43],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0]